{"slug":"/students/subjects/physics/physics-electricity/","source":"students/subjects/physics/physics-electricity.html","area":"students","kind":"division","title":"Electricity & Magnetism - Physics","description":"","subject":"physics","body":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Electricity &amp; Magnetism - Physics</title>\n  \n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n\n\n\n\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css\">\n\n\n  <nav class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-blue-100 z-50\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/physics/\" class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 hover:underline\">← Back to Physics</a>\n      <img src=\"/site/assets/images/logo.png\" alt=\"logo\" class=\"h-10 w-auto\">\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pt-24 pb-12\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-blue-700 mb-4\">Electricity &amp; Magnetism</h1>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"topic-card rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700\">Electrostatics</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Electric charges &amp; Coulomb's law</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"topic-card rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700\">Current Electricity</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Ohm's law, circuits, power</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"topic-card rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5